error[alternate-not-allowed]: a section heading has one wording, so it takes no `=group.variant`
  --> errors-annotations.md:8:15
  |
8 | ## Experience <!-- =experience.default -->
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: remove the `=group.variant`; keep the priority, status, and tags

error[annotation-unknown-keyword]: `@cor` is not an annotation keyword
   --> errors-annotations.md:12:26
   |
12 | - Led the platform. <!-- @cor -->
   |                          ^^^^
   |
   = help: did you mean `@core`?
   = help: the keywords are `@core`, `@extra`, `@draft`, and `@verify`; a topic is a `#tag`

error[annotation-malformed]: `AI` is not a valid tag name
   --> errors-annotations.md:13:27
   |
13 | - Built the gateway. <!-- #AI -->
   |                           ^^^
   |
   = help: names are lowercase letters and digits, starting with a letter, with single hyphens, at most 40 characters

error[annotation-conflict]: a second priority in one annotation
   --> errors-annotations.md:14:26
   |
14 | - Shipped it. <!-- @core @extra -->
   |                          ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: an item has at most one priority; keep the one you mean

error[annotation-misplaced]: an annotation must be the last thing on the line it marks
   --> errors-annotations.md:15:7
   |
15 | - Ran <!-- #ai --> the team.
   |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: put the annotation at the end of the line it marks, or alone on the line directly above it

error[annotation-duplicate]: a second annotation for the same item
   --> errors-annotations.md:17:1
   |
17 | <!-- #ai -->
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: an item takes one annotation; merge them into one comment
   = help: merge the two annotation lines into one comment

error[annotation-detached]: a blank line separates the annotation from the line below it
   --> errors-annotations.md:21:1
   |
21 | <!-- #data -->
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: a comment alone on a line marks only the line directly below it; remove what is in between

error[annotation-without-target]: an annotation on its own line has nothing after it to annotate
   --> errors-annotations.md:26:3
   |
26 |   <!-- #indented -->
   |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: to mark the next bullet, start the comment where that bullet's `-` starts

